'''G1 Climax 2026 Day 1''' was the opening show of the [[G1 Climax 2026]] tournament produced by [[New Okaiken Pro-Wrestling|NOPW]], held on September 5, 2026 at the Okami Municipal Gymnasium in [[Okami]]. The show featured all five [[G1 Climax 2026|Block A]] Round 1 matches — the tournament's opening night, and the first G1 in NOPW history to include the reigning [[IGO Heavyweight Championship|IGO Heavyweight Champion]] as a participant since 2019.

The night is remembered for three things: the champion's statement win; [[Marcus Vance]]'s exposure of [[The Marauder]] using the blueprint [[Tadayoshi Ishida]] had drawn at [[NOPW Wednesday Episode 10|Episode 10]]; and the match of the night between [[Kawada Masahiro]] and [[Nakamura Shinsuke]] — an 18-minute war in which both men kicked out of the other's finisher.

